title: "Uniquea: the HAT record, tests and workbooks"
type: dataset
authors:
  - family-names: Griffin
    given-names: Stephen M.
    alias: Phantom.O.Vanish
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0005-8386-3999"
repository-code: "https://github.com/phantomovanish/Uniquea"
url: "https://github.com/phantomovanish/Uniquea"
date-released: 2026-11-09
abstract: >-
  A framework, its mathematics and the tests that check it, with every claim shelved under HAT
  (Honest, Accurate, Truth). Includes the Hubble closure test, a breathing limit from DESI DR2 and
  Pantheon+, the EPR verdict, and a test of one acceleration scale against 153 SPARC galaxies.
keywords:
  - cosmology
  - MOND
  - Bell inequality
  - limit cycle
  - reproducibility
